(text "PIO expansion port (CN103), pin numbers as psx-spx (console rear view). On a stock\nconsole pin 5 (SBEN) and pin 39 (/CS2) are GND and pins 31/65 are NC; they carry\nSBEN, /CS2, /IRQ2 and /CS5 only with a Switch Board mod. The 3.3 V pins feed the\nwhole cart; 7.5 V and A21-A23 are unused." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7439baf9-2fde-4b2c-bba6-da0118eb81ae"))
